{
  "slug": "notion-memory",
  "name": "Notion Memory",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Give Claude long-term memory across sessions using your Notion workspace. Claude remembers your preferences, decisions, project context, and session history. Remembers preferences, tools, communication style, and tracks decisions with reasoning and dates.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `notion-knowledge-capture` (Transforms conversations and discussions into structured documentation pages in Notion), `notion-meeting-intelligence` (Prepares meeting materials by gathering context from Notion, enriching with Claude research, and creating both an internal pre-read…), `notion-memory`, `notion-research-documentation` (Searches across your Notion workspace, synthesizes findings from multiple pages, and creates comprehensive research documentation saved as new…), `notion-spec-to-implementation` (Turns product or tech specs into concrete Notion tasks that Claude code can implement)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install notion-memory@claude-community` from `MSApps-Mobile/claude-plugins` (`plugins/notion-memory`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
